  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Trossets explores the emergence of diversity. Combining twelve construction blocks the system generates endless patterns with a unique result each iteration. Trossets /trusɛts/ means parts, blocks, pieces and it’s my particular homage to a classical generative system, the multiscale Truchet tiles. The systems plays an interlocking blocks game creating unexpected drawings with colors borrowed from the Mediterranean."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://www.artblocks.io/project/147\">Trossets</a>",
      "cite": "1.000 editions of a long-form generative art project and algorithm, hosted on the Ethereum blockchain.<br>ArtBlocks Curated season 4."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "/assets/projects/trossets/trossets_flyer2.png",
      "width": 900,
      "height": 506,
      "alt": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "You can browse Trossets images on <a href=\"https://filter-blocks.netlify.app/project/147\">Filter Blocks</a> or <a href=\"https://archipelago.art/collections/trossets\">Archipelago</a>, which have great tools for filtering images by traits."
    },
