      "text": "Today is the day to reveal some truth. Apologies for misleading you two years ago.\n\nJoin me as we uncover some secrets while meeting Garrofeta la fallera, renowned chef Adrián Ferrán, and a wild boar named Pata Negra\n\nStay tuned! The first story will be released in just 1 hour ⏳",
