      "url": "https://twitter.com/carreras_anna/status/1698266720157532200",
      "text": "This is the true true true story of Toñi León and Riachuelo de Llovizna, who nurtured the vibrant colors of Buganvilea's Trossets.\n\nMy apologies for deceiving you two years ago: https://x.com/carreras_anna/status/1440041481402609673",
