      "text": "Unveiling the #inspirationStory of Trossets color Ibiza: the legendary Tintilla Blue Cocktail 🥃 🔷 🔴\n\nThe creative spark was ignited by visionary chef Adrián Ferrán, who accidentally invented this unique cocktail 🧵 ↓\n\nTintilla cocktail, Trosset #980, #262, and #937",
